        </button>
        <h2 class="sc-heading">Assets & Property</h2>
        <p class="sc-subtext">A rough range is fine — this helps us estimate the right level of planning.</p>

        <span class="sc-label">Estimated total net worth</span>
        <button class="sc-option" data-group="assetRange" data-value="under500k" onclick="selectOption(this)">
          <div class="sc-option-radio"><svg class="check-svg" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></div>
          <div><div class="sc-option-text">Under $500,000</div></div>
